{"seq":3,"slug":"challenges","title":"挑战","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/challenges","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"overfitting-nnpu","title":"nnPU 的过拟合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/challenges/overfitting-nnpu","wordCount":1641,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"prior-shift","title":"先验偏移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/challenges/prior-shift","wordCount":1554,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"selection-bias","title":"选择偏差：SAR 与倾向得分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/challenges/selection-bias","wordCount":1686,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"挑战\">挑战</h1><p>方法章里的公式在干净假设下都很漂亮。真实数据不干净，这一章就把三处最常见的「假设破裂」拆开讲，每一处都对应工业落地时踩过的坑。</p>\n<p>第一篇（<code>1_overfitting-nnpu.md</code>）深挖训练层面的失败：即便用了非负修正，nnPU 在高容量模型上依旧会过拟合——正类风险被压到过低、验证 AUC 悄悄下滑。它讲清过拟合的机理、Kiryo 等人提出的大梯度回退技巧，以及近年基于自校正、方差约束的改进变体。</p>\n<p>第二篇（<code>2_prior-shift.md</code>）处理分布层面的失败：训练时估的类先验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，到了部署环境可能整体变了（先验偏移 / 标签偏移）。这会让固定阈值失准、把校准好的概率带偏。它讲如何检测偏移、如何只用目标域的未标注数据重估先验并重新校准。</p>\n<p>第三篇（<code>3_selection-bias.md</code>）处理更根本的假设破裂：SCAR 说正例是被完全随机标注的，可现实里「哪些正例会被标」往往依赖样本本身的属性（SAR，选择偏差）。它引入倾向得分与逆倾向加权，介绍 PUSB、PULSNAR 等在 SAR 下仍能工作的方法。</p>\n<p>这三篇分别对应「优化没收敛好」「分布变了」「标注机制本身有偏」三种病因。读的时候不妨对照实践章的评估篇——很多时候你先在评估上看到异常，再回到这一章定位是哪一类问题。</p>\n"}